# Inditex Podcast Player — Cursor Rules

## Stack

- React + TypeScript (strict), Webpack 5, React Router (no hash routing)
- Native CSS only — no Tailwind, MUI, Bootstrap, or CSS-in-JS libraries
- Vitest + Testing Library for unit tests; Playwright for e2e
- Feature-oriented hexagonal architecture under `src/features/podcasts`

## Architecture boundaries

- `domain/` — models, value objects, ports (interfaces). No React, no fetch.
- `application/` — use cases. Depend on ports only.
- `infrastructure/` — iTunes API, AllOrigins proxy, localStorage cache, AbortController
- `ui/` — pages, components, hooks. Call use cases, never Apple URLs directly.

## Commits

- Conventional Commits in **English**: `type(scope): subject`
- Types: `feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `test`, `refactor`, `chore`, `perf`, `ci`, `build`
- Prefer small commits; reference backlog IDs when relevant (`Refs E2`)

## Quality bar

- Cache top podcasts and podcast details for 24 hours in localStorage
- Sanitize episode HTML with DOMPurify
- Cancel in-flight requests with AbortController on navigation
- Log errors to the browser console only (no user-facing error UI required)
- Keep README and docs in English
